      "title": "ORAN: eAxC ID flexible bit allocations",
      "message": "ORAN: eAxC ID flexible bit allocations\n\neAxC ID is 16 bits, consists of DU Port ID, BandSector ID, CC ID and RU\nPort ID with flexible bits width by operator preference.\n\nadded expert info at inconsistent eAxC bit width.\nused proto_tree_add_bits_ret_val().\n\nreference: O-RAN WG4.CUS.0 v09.00.\nsection 5.1.3.2.7 ecpriRtcid/ecpriPcid\n",
